{
  "note": "Synthetic paste fixtures representative of common real-world clipboard payloads. Direct capture from Google Docs / Notion / Word / GitHub is a follow-up — agent runtime has no GUI browser, so this initial corpus is hand-authored covering the same shape spectrum the research doc enumerates (rich-formatted spans, table HTML, code blocks, lists, mixed inline). Each entry must include text/plain; text/html is optional. Source-preservation invariant: bytes outside the cursor position pre-paste must be byte-identical to bytes before / after the inserted span post-paste.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "name": "plain-text-only",
      "text_plain": "Hello, world!"
    },
    {
      "name": "html-paragraph-with-formatting",
      "text_plain": "Hello bold italic.",
      "text_html": "<p>Hello <b>bold</b> <i>italic</i>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "html-bullet-list",
      "text_plain": "one\ntwo\nthree",
      "text_html": "<ul><li>one</li><li>two</li><li>three</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "name": "html-table",
      "text_plain": "A\tB\nC\tD",
      "text_html": "<table><tr><td>A</td><td>B</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>D</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "name": "html-link",
      "text_plain": "click here",
      "text_html": "<a href=\"https://example.test/page\">click here</a>"
    },
    {
      "name": "google-docs-style-spans",
      "text_plain": "Mixed formatting paragraph.",
      "text_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-size:11pt;color:#000000;\">Mixed <span style=\"font-weight:700;\">formatting</span> <span style=\"font-style:italic;\">paragraph</span>.</span>"
    },
    {
      "name": "word-mso-paragraph",
      "text_plain": "Word-style paragraph.",
      "text_html": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Word-style paragraph.</span></p><!--EndFragment-->"
    },
    {
      "name": "github-rendered-code-block",
      "text_plain": "const x = 1;\nconsole.log(x);",
      "text_html": "<pre><code class=\"language-js\">const x = 1;\nconsole.log(x);\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "name": "nested-divs",
      "text_plain": "outer\ninner one\ninner two",
      "text_html": "<div>outer<div>inner one</div><div>inner two</div></div>"
    },
    {
      "name": "h1-and-paragraph",
      "text_plain": "Heading\nBody text.",
      "text_html": "<h1>Heading</h1><p>Body text.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "inline-code-and-strong",
      "text_plain": "Use foo() to get bar.",
      "text_html": "Use <code>foo()</code> to get <strong>bar</strong>."
    },
    {
      "name": "multi-line-quoted",
      "text_plain": "line one\nline two\nline three",
      "text_html": "<blockquote><p>line one</p><p>line two</p><p>line three</p></blockquote>"
    },
    {
      "name": "tsv-plain-text",
      "text_plain": "方法\t优化目标\t代价 / 局限性\n引用计数\t立即回收，实现简单\t无法回收循环引用\n标记-清除\t简单，能处理循环\t暂停程序，产生碎片"
    },
    {
      "name": "tab-indented-code",
      "text_plain": "\tconst x = 1;\n\tconsole.log(x);"
    },
    {
      "name": "chat-answer-heading-and-bold-bullets",
      "text_plain": "Options\nOption A — fastest to ship.\nOption B — safest, slower.",
      "text_html": "<h2>Options</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Option A</strong> — fastest to ship.</p></li><li><p><strong>Option B</strong> — safest, slower.</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "name": "chatgpt-code-block-with-toolbar",
      "text_plain": "typescript\nCopy code\nconst x = 1;\nexport default x;",
      "text_html": "<pre class=\"overflow-visible\"><div><div class=\"header\">typescript</div><button>Copy code</button><div class=\"overflow-y-auto\"><code class=\"whitespace-pre language-typescript\">const x = 1;\nexport default x;\n</code></div></div></pre>"
    },
    {
      "name": "katex-inline-math",
      "text_plain": "Energy: E=mc2E = mc^2E=mc2 holds.",
      "text_html": "<p>Energy: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\">E=mc2</span></span></span> holds.</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "google-docs-bold-wrapper-list",
      "text_plain": "first\nsecond",
      "text_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-1\"><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">first</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">second</span></p></li></ul></b>"
    },
    {
      "name": "prose-around-table",
      "text_plain": "Compare:\nName\tCost\nA\t1",
      "text_html": "<p>Compare:</p><table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Cost</th></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>1</td></tr></table>"
    }
  ]
